    "Details": "The Voodoo SL-F101 serves as a scout, equipped with a Beagle active probe to spot hidden threats. For self defense it carries an SRM 2, medium laser and a Rocket Launcher 10, though with only three tons of armor it remains fragile if caught in active combat.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Land Air Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>",
